  "notes": "Inkling S9 phase B (tasks/inkling-spec.md D-I-S9B): the Inkling 2 Mini GPU0 deployment of native-g0-inkling-2-mini-v1 (family inkling2_loop, 48 visits over 24 physical layers, NVFP4 / MXFP8 experts as stored, BF16 dense, up to 4 sessions, chunked prefill up to 4,096 rows, eager) plus the MTP drafter (mtp.safetensors, profile rtxpro6000bw-inkling-vision-mtp-v1: role draft and S7's vision tower on the device) and speculative_draft_tokens 4 (the verify window, 2..8 allowed on this family; 4 priced on GPU0, verify time steps up at 5 rows): a greedy ticket without logprobs, text or image, decodes through speculate_rows, 4 verify rows per session per round (the unfed token plus the drafter block's first 3 drafts), exact greedy accept, output bit-identical to plain greedy decode. A sampled or logprobs ticket carries CERE_WORK_NO_SPECULATION and decodes on plain decode's path (K12's sampler, up to 20 logprobs). Auto tool calls (the inkling parser, S6); images (the sidecar's Inkling image processor, feature image). No prefix cache, snapshot, LoRA, grammar, research points or lever other than the defaults.",
